| Raw KV kept in GPU memory | 0 ms | GPU | 896 MiB |
| Raw KV in CPU memory, copied back (pinned / pageable) | 39 / 68 ms | CPU | 896 MiB |
| Ours (per layer, uniform, search) kept in GPU memory, decoded | 34 ms | GPU | 504 MiB |
